Henry: answer_card verb relays the owner's answer to a parked card

steer is HELD while a card waits on an owner question, so answers given in the
board chat never reached the worker. answer_card hands the owner's words to
sessions.answer_question (actor owner-via-henry, request_id = current question,
audit row with the underlying owner message). Refused without an owner message
in the turn (broker/wakes); stale question -> 409. Card question rows with
option buttons already exist (card_mirror + card_question.tsx).

